        "message": "=Dear Applicant,\n\nThank you for your interest in joining Kandhari Beverages Pvt. Ltd. and for taking the time to submit your application.\n\nWe are pleased to confirm that your application has been successfully received and forwarded to our Human Resources team for review.\n\nOur recruitment team will carefully evaluate your qualifications, experience, and suitability for the role. If your profile is shortlisted, we will contact you regarding the next stages of the selection process.\n\nWe kindly request your patience during the review period and appreciate your interest in building a career with Kandhari Beverages Pvt. Ltd.\n\nThank you for considering us as a potential employer.\n\nKind Regards,\n\nHuman Resources Department\nKandhari Beverages Pvt. Ltd.",
