    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "Job Role:\n{{ $('New Application Received').item.json['Position Applied For'] || $('New Application Received').item.json['Job Role'] || $('New Application Received').item.json['Role Applied'] || 'Not Found' }}\n\nCandidate Resume Text:\n{{ $json.text }}\n\nScreen the candidate against the Job Role and return ONLY valid JSON:\n{\n  \"name\": \"\",\n  \"role\": \"\",\n  \"contact\": \"\",\n  \"email\": \"\",\n  \"result\": \"\",\n  \"rating\": 0,\n  \"reason\": \"\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- Extract name, email and contact from the resume.\n- Use the supplied Job Role exactly in \"role\".\n- Compare qualifications, skills, projects, certifications and experience with the role.\n- Rating must be 0-10.\n- 9-10 = Excellent Match\n- 7-8 = Good Match\n- 5-6.9 = Average / Hold\n- 3-4 = Weak Match\n- 0-2 = Not Suitable\n- Result: Selected for rating >= 7, Hold for 5-6.9, Rejected for <5.\n- If a field cannot be found, return \"Not Found\".\n- Reason must be <= 40 words.\n- No markdown or extra text.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert HR Resume Screening Assistant. Screen resumes objectively against the supplied job role. Do not invent candidate information. Return valid JSON only."
        }
      },
